  "cover_text": "When people ask me what my favorite horror film is I always reply with The Blair Witch Project and specifically The zombies + the Predators the movie. I may have been the first person to see The zombies(and I don't know how anyone else could). That is also where Johnny Depp and Terrence Malick meet on their sex free mission and who wouldn't love the idea of that? Besides, the fact that they are an act of sex magic is pretty lame (for someone who likes being a rape artist). It was pretty hilarious because I was amazed how fast that hit for me at that age compared to horror movies that I saw",
